			"Message": "refactor(Project): Standardize DTO serialization to camelCase and fix SCM provider registration\n\nSubmodule synchronization across multiple components:\n\n1. Mountain (11b3c822):\n   - Migrate DTO serialization from PascalCase to camelCase across 13 files (CustomDocumentStateDTO, DocumentStateDTO, MarkerDataDTO, etc.) to match the wire format expected by Wind/Sky\n   - Fix SCM provider registration: change PascalCase keys (\"ID\", \"Label\", \"RootUri\") to camelCase (\"id\", \"label\", \"rootUri\") in RegisterScmProvider and add missing \"providerHandle\" field in RegisterScmResourceGroup\n   - Add #[allow(dead_code)] to 15 structs used only in specific build configs\n   - Set MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=10.13 for broader compatibility\n\n2. Mist (94e88d14): Add #![allow(non_snake_case)] lint to permit PascalCase naming conventions consistent with the rest of CodeEditorLand\n\n3. Rest (cf44ea79): Switch binary entry point from Library.rs to Main.rs with proper async tokio runtime\n\nImpact: Wind/Sky now receive correctly formatted DTOs with camelCase keys, SCM source control providers properly register, and the Rest bundler has correct binary structure.",
			"SHA": "3cfc021ed28fb28f64d06171469713f00c88bf0b"
